# LUCR Debt Settlement Engine

> Decentralized LUCR token escrow and fiat off-ramp bridge that locks member or treasury allocations on-chain for targeted creditor tradeline paydowns, triggering automated ACH disbursements and releasing or refunding tokens upon settlement confirmation.

## Architecture

```text
lucr-debt-settlement/
├── apps/
│   └── api-gateway/         # Express server running the settlement watcher & off-ramp bridge
├── packages/
│   └── debt-optimizer/      # Solidity contract (LucrDebtSettlement.sol) & ethers.js event watcher
├── .env.example
├── package.json
└── tsconfig.json
